sequenceDiagram
  participant R1 as request r1
  participant R2 as request r2
  participant G as TenantGovernor
  R1->>G: reserve 70 tokens / $0.70
  G-->>R1: admitted, concurrency=1
  R2->>G: reserve 40 tokens / $0.40
  Note over G: 70+40 > 100, or concurrency full
  G-->>R2: queued (bounded)
  R1->>G: cancel or complete
  G->>G: release concurrency / commit actual usage
  G-->>R2: FIFO promote when capacity fits
